Yes.  2-handers are just asking for trouble, even artifacts--
eliminating easily avoided problems is important in nethack,
especially ones that require you to actively check in after particular
messages with no warning (e.g. blessed status of the Staff).

More importantly, it's a kind of crappy weapon since against drain-
resistant monsters (which includes many of the handful of monsters
where you actually care about damage) it completely sucks.



